<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#513052"><title>Emma — AI Care Companion</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/sky.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/night.css"></head>
<body><div class="sky" aria-hidden="true"><div class="cloud-layer"></div><div class="cloud-veil"></div><div class="cloud-near"></div></div><main class="shell"><header class="topbar"><span class="brand-small">AI CARE COMPANION</span><button id="nightToggle" class="theme-button" aria-label="Switch to night mode" aria-pressed="false">☾ Night</button><button id="careToggle" class="settings-button" aria-label="Open care records and settings" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="careDrawer">⚙</button></header>

<div id="storageWarning" class="notice hidden" role="alert"></div><section class="hero card"><h1 class="emma-wordmark">EMMA</h1><p class="emma-subtitle">Your care companion</p><div class="orb-wrap"><button id="talkBtn" class="orb" aria-label="Talk to Emma"><span class="orb-core"></span><span class="light-ring" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div><h2 id="voiceState" role="status" aria-live="polite">I’m here with you.</h2><p id="voiceHint" role="status" aria-live="polite">Tap once, then speak normally.</p><svg id="patientWave" class="patient-wave" viewBox="0 0 600 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,50 Q150,46 300,50 T600,50"/><path d="M0,50 Q150,46 300,50 T600,50"/><path d="M0,50 Q150,46 300,50 T600,50"/></svg><div id="listeningLabel" class="listening-label">Ready when you are</div><div class="conversation-controls"><button id="muteToggle" disabled aria-pressed="false">Mute</button><button id="talkToggle" class="primary">Start conversation</button><button id="typeToggle" class="secondary">Text</button></div><div id="typeBox" class="type-box hidden"><input aria-label="Message for Emma" maxlength="1200" id="textInput" placeholder="Tell Emma what's happening…"><button id="sendText" class="primary small">Send</button></div><p id="typedFeedback" class="typed-feedback hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="medicationConfirm" class="hidden"><button class="primary" id="confirmMedication">Yes, remember that</button><button class="ghost" id="cancelMedication">Cancel</button></div><div id="memoryConfirm" class="notice hidden"><p id="pendingMemoryText"></p><button class="primary" id="confirmMemory">Yes, remember this</button><button class="ghost" id="cancelMemory">Don’t save</button></div>
<div class="row"><span class="pill" id="energyStatus">At your pace</span><button class="ghost" id="energyToggle">I’m tired today</button></div>
<details class="conversation-details"><summary>This conversation</summary><p class="muted">Only shown during this visit. Reloading clears this view.</p><div id="conversation" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions"></div></details><audio id="remoteAudio" autoplay></audio></section>
<section id="careDrawer" class="care-drawer hidden"><button id="closeCare" class="ghost close-care">Back to Emma</button><h2 id="greeting">Your care companion</h2><p class="muted privacy-note">Voice uses OpenAI, including audio and relevant saved context. Typed conversation may also use OpenAI. Explicit preferences and energy settings are handled locally. Browser records are not encrypted; exported backups are.</p><details class="credit-details">
<summary id="creditCounter" style="cursor:pointer">Estimated credit remaining: set balance</summary>
<p id="creditNote"></p>
<button class="ghost" id="setCreditBalance">Set current balance</button>
<a href="https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/billing/overview" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open OpenAI billing</a>
<p>Testing only · USD · Rates checked September 15, 2026 · <a href="https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pricing reference</a>. Set the balance between sessions after checking billing. Tracks future reported voice, transcription and interpretation usage; cannot recover earlier costs. Use one Emma tab for testing.</p>
</details><section class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="section-head"><h3>Today</h3><span class="pill" id="eventCount">0 events</span></div><div id="todaySummary" class="summary">Nothing logged yet.</div></article><article class="card"><div class="section-head"><h3>Open loops</h3><span class="pill" id="loopCount">0</span></div><div id="loops" class="list muted">Nothing waiting.</div><details><summary>Handled items</summary><div id="closedLoops" class="list"></div></details></article></section>
<section class="card"><h3>Appointment preparation</h3><p class="muted">Recorded visits only; Emma does not book appointments or send notifications. Questions below are a shared care-team list, not assigned to one visit.</p><div id="appointments" class="list"></div><h3 style="margin-top:18px">Questions to bring</h3><div id="appointmentQuestions" class="list"></div><p class="muted">Say “Add a question for my doctor: Could we discuss my sleep?” Then ask “What did I want to discuss with my doctor?”</p></section><nav class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-tab="journey">Journey</button><button class="tab" data-tab="memory">Memory</button><button class="tab" data-tab="debug">Debug</button></nav>
<section id="journeyPanel" class="panel card"><div class="section-head"><h3>Journey</h3><span class="muted">Newest first</span></div><label class="search-label" for="journeySearch">Find in your journey</label><input type="search" id="journeySearch" placeholder="Try tingling, water, or a medicine name"><div id="journey" class="timeline"></div></section>
<section id="memoryPanel" class="panel card hidden"><div class="section-head"><h3>What Emma knows</h3><span class="muted">Stored on this device</span></div><h3>Medications and your names for them</h3><p class="muted">Name checks send only the medication name to NLM RxNorm. Matches still need your confirmation against the label. If unsure, say “It is spelled” followed by letters, or type the name.</p><div id="medicationList" class="memory-grid"></div><h3>Personal memory</h3><p class="muted">Tell Emma about important people, routines, or comforts—for example, “My daughter Sarah usually takes me to appointments.” Emma asks before saving. Later, ask “Who takes me to appointments?” or “What helps me relax?” Say “Remember privately…” for a memory excluded from future AI context.</p><div id="memory" class="memory-grid"></div></section>
<section id="debugPanel" class="panel card hidden"><div class="section-head"><h3>Developer debug</h3><span class="muted">Prototype only</span></div><label><input type="checkbox" id="debugEnabled"> Capture debug details for this visit</label><p class="muted">Includes transcripts when enabled. Not included in saved records or backups. The current context preview below may contain health information.</p><pre id="debug"></pre></section><section class="card backup-panel"><details><summary>Your data &amp; backup</summary>
<p>Make an encrypted copy of your Emma. Keep your passphrase separately; there is no password recovery. This prototype backup contains your records, not audio, usage estimates, or pending confirmations.</p>
<label for="backupPassword">Backup passphrase (at least 12 characters)</label><input id="backupPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12">
<div class="row"><button id="exportBackup" class="secondary">Download encrypted backup</button></div>
<label for="backupFile">Restore an existing .emma backup</label><input id="backupFile" type="file" accept=".emma,application/json">
<div class="row"><button id="restoreBackup" class="secondary">Review and restore</button><button id="recoverPrevious" class="ghost">Recover previous save</button></div>
<p id="backupStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
</details></section><button class="ghost" id="resetBtn">Reset prototype data</button></section><footer>Build: memory-routing-2 · Prototype only. Do not use for urgent or clinical decision-making.</footer></main><script type="module" src="/boot.mjs?v=memory-routing-2"></script></body></html>